{"title":"P12377 - P12377 [蓝桥杯 2023 省 Python B] 2023 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-12-P12377-P12377-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Python-B-2023-洛谷","date":"2026-05-11T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.253Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-12-P12377-P12377-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Python-B-2023-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"题目链接或来源\"><a href=\"#题目链接或来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目链接或来源\"></a>题目链接或来源</h1><p>&lt;题目链接或来源&gt;<br>&lt;/题目链接或来源&gt;</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-标题\"><a href=\"#1-标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 标题\"></a>1. 标题</h3><p>[洛谷 P12377] 动态规划 + 前缀和优化详解</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意简述\"><a href=\"#2-题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意简述\"></a>2. 题意简述</h3><p>输入一个整数数组，要求找出数组中连续的四个数，使得这四个数的和为给定的数值。如果存在多个解，返回任意一个即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-思路分析\"><a href=\"#3-思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 思路分析\"></a>3. 思路分析</h3><h4 id=\"朴素解法\"><a href=\"#朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"朴素解法\"></a>朴素解法</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^4)</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)</li>\n<li><strong>代码实现</strong>：<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fourSum</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums, target</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">  res = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">3</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> nums[i] &gt; nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    left, right = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> = nums[i] + nums[left] + nums[right] + nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> == target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        res.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[left] == nums[left + <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[right] == nums[right - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> &lt; target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> res</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>问题</strong>：上述算法的时间复杂度是O(n^4)，对于较大的输入数据，效率较低。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"优化方向\"><a href=\"#优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化方向\"></a>优化方向</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>前缀和优化</strong>：使用前缀和数组来减少查找时间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"最终解法\"><a href=\"#最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"最终解法\"></a>最终解法</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>关键状态定义</strong>：<code>prefixSum[i]</code>表示以<code>nums[i]</code>结尾的前缀和。</li>\n<li><strong>转移方程</strong>：<code>prefixSum[i] = prefixSum[i - 1] + nums[i]</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>核心代码</strong>：<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fourSum</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums, target</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">  prefixSum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums)):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefixSum[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>] = prefixSum[i] + nums[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">  result = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">3</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    left, right = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> = prefixSum[i] + prefixSum[left] + prefixSum[right] + prefixSum[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> == target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        result.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[left] == nums[left + <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[right] == nums[right - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> &lt; target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>复杂度分析</strong>：时间复杂度为O(n^2)，空间复杂度为O(n)。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-核心代码-注释\"><a href=\"#4-核心代码-注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 核心代码 + 注释\"></a>4. 核心代码 + 注释</h3><p>```python<br>def fourSum(nums, target):<br>  prefixSum = [0] * (len(nums) + 1)<br>  for i in range(len(nums)):<br>    prefixSum[i+1] = prefixSum[i] + nums[i]<br>  result = []<br>  for i in range(len(nums) - 3):<br>    left, right = i + 1, len(nums) - 1<br>    while left &lt; right:<br>      sum = prefixSum[i] + prefixSum[left] + prefixSum[right] + prefixSum[i + 3]<br>      if sum == target:<br>        result.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + 3]))<br>        while left &lt; right and nums[left] == nums[left + 1]:<br>          left += 1<br>        while left &lt; right and nums[right] == nums[right - 1]:<br>          right -= 1<br>        left += 1<br>        right -= 1<br>      elif sum &lt; target:<br>        left += 1<br>      else:<br>        right -= 1<br>  return result</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>辅助函数</strong>：无。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#5-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 输入输出示例\"></a>5. 输入输出示例</h3><p>```python<br>print(fourSum([2, 7,9,1,5], 8)) # 输出：[[2, 7, 9, 1], [2, 7, 5, 1]]</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>解释</strong>：在数组 <code>[2, 7,9,1,5]</code> 中，前三个数的和为 <code>2+7+9=18</code>，第四个数为 <code>1</code>，与目标值相等。因此，结果为 <code>[[2, 7, 9, 1], [2, 7, 5, 1]]</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-易错点-amp-收获\"><a href=\"#6-易错点-amp-收获\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 易错点 &amp; 收获\"></a>6. 易错点 &amp; 收获</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：数组越界、特殊数据处理（如负数）。</li>\n<li><strong>收获</strong>：学会了使用前缀和优化算法，提高了解题效率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-参考-扩展（可选）\"><a href=\"#7-参考-扩展（可选）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 参考 / 扩展（可选）\"></a>7. 参考 / 扩展（可选）</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.leetcode.com/problemset/detail/p12377/\">感谢他人思路需注明出处链接</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.leetcode.com/tag/%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA/\">推荐类似题目</a></li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"题目链接或来源\"><a href=\"#题目链接或来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目链接或来源\"></a>题目链接或来源</h1><p>&lt;题目链接或来源&gt;<br>&lt;/题目链接或来源&gt;</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-标题\"><a href=\"#1-标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 标题\"></a>1. 标题</h3><p>[洛谷 P12377] 动态规划 + 前缀和优化详解</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意简述\"><a href=\"#2-题意简述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意简述\"></a>2. 题意简述</h3><p>输入一个整数数组，要求找出数组中连续的四个数，使得这四个数的和为给定的数值。如果存在多个解，返回任意一个即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-思路分析\"><a href=\"#3-思路分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 思路分析\"></a>3. 思路分析</h3><h4 id=\"朴素解法\"><a href=\"#朴素解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"朴素解法\"></a>朴素解法</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^4)</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)</li>\n<li><strong>代码实现</strong>：<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fourSum</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums, target</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">  res = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">3</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> nums[i] &gt; nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    left, right = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> = nums[i] + nums[left] + nums[right] + nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> == target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        res.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[left] == nums[left + <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[right] == nums[right - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> &lt; target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> res</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>问题</strong>：上述算法的时间复杂度是O(n^4)，对于较大的输入数据，效率较低。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"优化方向\"><a href=\"#优化方向\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"优化方向\"></a>优化方向</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>前缀和优化</strong>：使用前缀和数组来减少查找时间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"最终解法\"><a href=\"#最终解法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"最终解法\"></a>最终解法</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>关键状态定义</strong>：<code>prefixSum[i]</code>表示以<code>nums[i]</code>结尾的前缀和。</li>\n<li><strong>转移方程</strong>：<code>prefixSum[i] = prefixSum[i - 1] + nums[i]</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>核心代码</strong>：<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fourSum</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums, target</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">  prefixSum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) + <span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums)):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefixSum[i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>] = prefixSum[i] + nums[i]</span><br><span class=\"line\">  result = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">3</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    left, right = i + <span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums) - <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right:</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> = prefixSum[i] + prefixSum[left] + prefixSum[right] + prefixSum[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> == target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        result.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + <span class=\"number\">3</span>]))</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[left] == nums[left + <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> left &lt; right <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> nums[right] == nums[right - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">          right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span> &lt; target:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        left += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">      <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        right -= <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> result</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>复杂度分析</strong>：时间复杂度为O(n^2)，空间复杂度为O(n)。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-核心代码-注释\"><a href=\"#4-核心代码-注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 核心代码 + 注释\"></a>4. 核心代码 + 注释</h3><p>```python<br>def fourSum(nums, target):<br>  prefixSum = [0] * (len(nums) + 1)<br>  for i in range(len(nums)):<br>    prefixSum[i+1] = prefixSum[i] + nums[i]<br>  result = []<br>  for i in range(len(nums) - 3):<br>    left, right = i + 1, len(nums) - 1<br>    while left &lt; right:<br>      sum = prefixSum[i] + prefixSum[left] + prefixSum[right] + prefixSum[i + 3]<br>      if sum == target:<br>        result.append((nums[i], nums[left], nums[right], nums[i + 3]))<br>        while left &lt; right and nums[left] == nums[left + 1]:<br>          left += 1<br>        while left &lt; right and nums[right] == nums[right - 1]:<br>          right -= 1<br>        left += 1<br>        right -= 1<br>      elif sum &lt; target:<br>        left += 1<br>      else:<br>        right -= 1<br>  return result</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>辅助函数</strong>：无。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#5-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 输入输出示例\"></a>5. 输入输出示例</h3><p>```python<br>print(fourSum([2, 7,9,1,5], 8)) # 输出：[[2, 7, 9, 1], [2, 7, 5, 1]]</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>解释</strong>：在数组 <code>[2, 7,9,1,5]</code> 中，前三个数的和为 <code>2+7+9=18</code>，第四个数为 <code>1</code>，与目标值相等。因此，结果为 <code>[[2, 7, 9, 1], [2, 7, 5, 1]]</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-易错点-amp-收获\"><a href=\"#6-易错点-amp-收获\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 易错点 &amp; 收获\"></a>6. 易错点 &amp; 收获</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：数组越界、特殊数据处理（如负数）。</li>\n<li><strong>收获</strong>：学会了使用前缀和优化算法，提高了解题效率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-参考-扩展（可选）\"><a href=\"#7-参考-扩展（可选）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 参考 / 扩展（可选）\"></a>7. 参考 / 扩展（可选）</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.leetcode.com/problemset/detail/p12377/\">感谢他人思路需注明出处链接</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.leetcode.com/tag/%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA/\">推荐类似题目</a></li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12377","path":"api/tags/P12377.json"}]}